    {
      "id": "claim_fb21cf293ebf4aadbefbaf301d0e84f5",
      "statement": "The package.json `dsh` object is the plugin's whole mount-announcement contract to the harness: `dsh.engines.dsh` sets the minimum harness version (currently \">=0.1.1-rc.1\"), `dsh.bundle.patch` points at ./cordis.patch.yml, and `dsh.client` declares platform \"web\" plus an inject list of five client shell faces (locale, runtime, ui-conversation, ui-layout, ui-sidebar), which makes the web module table scan the package into the browser roster and serve lib/client.js.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L50-L67",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a34f03d6e2e6166cba10206b57a685f9a8c5d3601488d2545c73abb4cb9d016b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_199384e9805f4fc382443a0dd8a62585",
      "statement": "dsh.bundle.patch points at cordis.patch.yml, which insert-only adds the `pet-panel` row to the web profile plugin roster; the row is the single mount entry for both faces — the modules Node half scans dsh.client packages into the web roster (serving lib/client.js), and the host half (src/index.ts) registers the skill/MCP/A2A gateways and the A2A inbound endpoint, applied automatically on install.",
      "evidence": [
        {
