    {
      "id": "claim_6a501fc9c448472f9dd251a00f7821e0",
      "statement": "The host face's seven plugins inject the cordis services they consume: SkillForgeGateway injects ['llm','agentDefaultModel']; ToolIntegrationsGateway injects ['loader'] to hot-mount MCP loader entries; A2AToolsPlugin injects ['tools'] to register model-facing tools; A2AInboundPlugin injects ['webServer','agents','sessions','agentDefaultModel'] to register the agent-card and /a2a endpoints and run the agent loop; ProfileSkillProviderPlugin injects ['skills'] to register a per-profile skill provider; TeamGateway injects ['llm','agentDefaultModel'] for the team 'me' self-reply path; A2AConfigGateway is pure file-backed and injects no harness service.",
