    {
      "id": "claim_1c040b3484ce411ca8406879cf82a7e1",
      "statement": "The client face injects its services across three cordis plugins: the main apply(ctx) injects ['slots','locale','remote'] and mounts the Typert remote manifest via ctx.remote.$mount(TYPERT_REMOTE); the pet-panel-capabilities child plugin injects ['slots','locale','remote','remote.skillForge','remote.toolIntegrations','remote.a2aConfig','remote.team'] so the remote.<ns> namespaces resolve only against the already-mounted services; the pet-panel-command child plugin injects ['inputTriggers','sessions'] to register the /pet slash source and consume input via the slash/input-consume-token bail event.",
