    {
      "id": "claim_bec5dd32cdbd4c4a9b399c53a12ee9d7",
      "statement": "The client registers components into six harness-declared SlotMap rows: conversation.view (dashboard order 20, skill-forge 30, tool-integrations 40, a2a-management 50), shell.overlay (pet default 0, team-panel order 110), sidebar.brand.mark and sidebar.brand.name (priority -1, PapergamesLogo/Wordmark), conversation.hero.brand.mark (priority -1, PapergamesLogo), and sidebar.footer.action (team order 5, background order 10); registration correctness depends on the harness semantics that list rows render by ascending order and single brand/hero rows resolve by lowest priority.",
