      "id": "claim_df860e2b2329452abf69d24da4c3ffaa",
      "statement": "The frozen browser module table is the single shared list of modules the shell shares into the web module table — react, react/jsx-runtime, react-dom, react-dom/client, @deepseek-ai/cordis, @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots, @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives — and the client bundle resolves these as externals via CLIENT_EXTERNALS = [...PLATFORM_MODULES, RUNTIME_STORE_EXEMPTION]; @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime/client is a documented temporary exemption, not a platform module.",
