      "id": "claim_fd18a5de86a344b9b751fba83da74c8f",
      "statement": "The contract's per-profile isolation is realized in the host data surfaces: skillRoot(), MCP_FILE(), and a2aConfigDir() resolve to the active profile's directory under $DSH_HOME/profiles/<name>/ rather than to process.cwd(), parsed from the always-present --profile flag in process.argv (with a non-profile fallback), so dsh --profile <name> from any cwd and cd <profile> && dsh land on the same config.",
