      "statement": "The client bundle inlines only two categories of @deepseek-ai/* modules besides the module-table externals: INLINE_SAFE (browser-safe wire/type contract surfaces @deepseek-ai/dsh-host-apiproxy, dsh-session, dsh-llm, dsh-tools, dsh-brand, which carry no shared runtime identity) and GENERATED_REMOTE (@deepseek-ai/dsh-*/remote descriptor/codec contributions). Everything else under @deepseek-ai/* is either a module-table external or a leak the purity gate rejects.",
